<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta launched a drone strike that damaged a Chinese gas pipeline facility and intensified air attacks on a historic Buddhist meditation centre, a monastery, villages in Sagaing and displacement camps in Rakhine, killing civilians. Chinese courts sentenced three Myanmar scam gang members to death. The United States held secret talks with Myanmar’s military-backed rulers in Tokyo, focusing on rare earth minerals. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/as-war-rages-myanmars-coup-leader-turned-president-wins-back-neighbours?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPUWpMVGJHdmxrQnR6QTZzWnBsTEk1VldyRmdLdmloMFBfYnNNZTg2YmxIMm02OXlTWTRsNkkxUDRONmJoLXc1bHMxcnloRS10dDJwdDg2SmMyN04xRTdmU1JUYzRBa2ZTNmI3aDlWc08zMTRGbnh0NWMwbmdYeElFNEtFdUxuUmxGMGNORVFfZmNGazNlaTFMa0FzcHJ4S01WMWZEQ3F6Rk1GeUJLVFBFNjdHSXJOdmprZURzYzQxTG11NTIzdFFXN1h0cEM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9GZnhMdjBYMzl3UXgyT3NfR1dmSG8yNk5DaGdRN1kweE9SMldYUUdSQmFDVnZRUEtLOVdzdlZ0ZlNjU3hqS0staGNsY25TSWw4WUk4YllWT1lHYjhnTDhNU3NuLVBiNlJZZDVvMlQ3OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar Digital News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE1LendKTXBrelMwbDZLeVNHY1l6eDJGSUdNS2JMYVR2Z2tPZUlWWFRPdllzdXhSLTRRSkJXZmd5cnhhRzREaHdjdmdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNM1lnVGR0SnNTMzluZk9HOWVUdUUtWTFQOEl